    "source_scene_file": "scene-038.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 52,
        "printed_page": 51
      }
    ],
    "text": "அடேடே உமா..நெற்றியிலே கீறிட்டுதா?...எங்கே?..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038-d002",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038",
    "scene_ordinal": 38,
    "source_scene_id": "28",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-28",
    "speaker_label": "உமா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-038.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 52,
        "printed_page": 51
      }
    ],
    "text": "(சோகமாக) புறா, நெத்தியில தான் கீறிச்சு!...ஆனா, நீங்க என் நெஞ்சிலேயே கீறிட்டீங்க!..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038-d003",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038",
    "scene_ordinal": 38,
    "source_scene_id": "28",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-28",
    "speaker_label": "விங்கன்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-038.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 52,
        "printed_page": 51
      }
    ],
    "text": "அதெல்லாம் சின்னக்காயம்! இன்னுமா ஆறும் இருக்கு? அந்தக் காயங்களைப் பாத்துப் பாத்து ரசிச்சு ஊமைப் புண்ணை புரியிறது பெண்களுக்கே ஒரு தனி இன்பம்னு நம்ம இலக்கியங்கள் கூறுகின்றன!.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038-d004",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038",
    "scene_ordinal": 38,
    "source_scene_id": "28",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-28",
    "speaker_label": "உமா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-038.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 52,
        "printed_page": 51
      }
    ],
    "text": "அந்த இன்பத்தின் விளைவுதான் என்னைத் துன்பத்தின் எல்லைக்கே துரத்திவிட்டது!.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038-d005",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038",
    "scene_ordinal": 38,
    "source_scene_id": "28",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-28",
    "speaker_label": "விங்கன்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-038.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 52,
        "printed_page": 51
      }
    ],
    "text": "என்ன சொல்றே?..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038-d006",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038",
    "scene_ordinal": 38,
    "source_scene_id": "28",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-28",
    "speaker_label": "உமா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-038.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 52,
        "printed_page": 51
      }
    ],
    "text": "நாம் ரெண்டு பேரும் செஞ்ச தவறு.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038-d007",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038",
    "scene_ordinal": 38,
    "source_scene_id": "28",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-28",
    "speaker_label": "விங்கன்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-038.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 52,
        "printed_page": 51
      }
    ],
    "text": "தவறு ஒண்ணுமில்ல...நீ தணலா இருந்தே!..நான் மெழுகா இருந்தேன்!..."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038-d008",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038",
    "scene_ordinal": 38,
    "source_scene_id": "28",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-28",
    "speaker_label": "உமா",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-038.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 52,
        "printed_page": 51
      }
    ],
    "text": "நான் ஒண்ணும் தணலா இல்லே!.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038-d009",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038",
    "scene_ordinal": 38,
    "source_scene_id": "28",
    "source_heading": "காட்சி-28",
    "speaker_label": "விங்கன்",
    "source_delimiter": ":—",
    "source_scene_file": "scene-038.md",
    "page_provenance": [
      {
        "pdf_page": 52,
        "printed_page": 51
      }
    ],
    "text": "சரி..நான் தணலா இருந்தேன்!..நீ மெழுகா இருந்தே!.."
  },
  {
    "id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038-d010",
    "scene_id": "vandikkaran-magan-s038",
    "scene_ordinal": 38,
    "source_scene_id": "28",
